@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@token = 请粘贴登录接口返回的access_token

### 系统首页
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

### 注册普通用户
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "HTTP测试用户",
  "age": 20,
  "username": "http_test_user",
  "password": "abc123456"
}

### 登录（表单请求）
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=http_test_user&password=abc123456

### 查询当前用户
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 修改当前用户
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "age": 21
}

### 查询自己的订单
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 管理员查询用户列表（需要 admin Token）
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/?skip=0&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
